 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "This map says Greenland is as big as Africa.",
   "t0": 0.08,
   "t1": 2.341,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 12,
   "syl_per_s": 5.31
  },
  {
   "text": "It's not even as big as Algeria.",
   "t0": 2.457,
   "t1": 4.222,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 10,
   "syl_per_s": 5.67
  },
  {
   "text": "Excuse me?",
   "t0": 4.442,
   "t1": 5.022,
   "speaker": "greenland",
   "gag": "excuse"
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the trick.",
   "t0": 5.322,
   "t1": 6.018,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 3,
   "syl_per_s": 4.31
  },
  {
   "text": "To flatten a round Earth, this map stretches land more and more toward the poles.",
   "t0": 6.401,
   "t1": 10.36,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 18,
   "syl_per_s": 4.55
  },
  {
   "text": "Up where Greenland sits, that's about SIXTEEN times too big.",
   "t0": 10.883,
   "t1": 14.087,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 13,
   "syl_per_s": 4.06
  },
  {
   "text": "So let's drag Greenland down to the equator, where the map tells the truth...",
   "t0": 14.691,
   "t1": 17.919,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 17,
   "syl_per_s": 5.27
  },
  {
   "text": "Watch it shrink.",
   "t0": 18.07,
   "t1": 18.789,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 3,
   "syl_per_s": 4.17
  },
  {
   "text": "And shrink.",
   "t0": 19.172,
   "t1": 19.765,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 2,
   "syl_per_s": 3.37
  },
  {
   "text": "And SHRINK.",
   "t0": 19.95,
   "t1": 20.763,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 2,
   "syl_per_s": 2.46
  },
  {
   "text": "Wait... what?!",
   "t0": 21.063,
   "t1": 21.853,
   "speaker": "greenland",
   "gag": "waitwhat"
  },
  {
   "text": "Now drop it on Africa.",
   "t0": 22.353,
   "t1": 23.555,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 7,
   "syl_per_s": 5.82
  },
  {
   "text": "Africa is FOURTEEN times bigger.",
   "t0": 23.894,
   "t1": 25.977,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 9,
   "syl_per_s": 4.32
  },
  {
   "text": "Even Algeria is bigger than Greenland.",
   "t0": 26.509,
   "t1": 28.4,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 11,
   "syl_per_s": 5.82
  },
  {
   "text": "So is DR Congo.",
   "t0": 29.0,
   "t1": 30.404,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 6,
   "syl_per_s": 4.27
  },
  {
   "text": "Hi, tiny.",
   "t0": 30.784,
   "t1": 31.339,
   "speaker": "algeria",
   "gag": "hitiny"
  },
  {
   "text": "In fact, put the USA, China, India, and all of Europe outside Russia together...",
   "t0": 31.699,
   "t1": 36.278,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 24,
   "syl_per_s": 5.24
  },
  {
   "text": "and Africa is STILL bigger.",
   "t0": 36.667,
   "t1": 38.042,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 8,
   "syl_per_s": 5.82
  },
  {
   "text": "With room to spare.",
   "t0": 38.542,
   "t1": 39.395,
   "speaker": "narrator",
   "syl": 4,
   "syl_per_s": 4.69
  },
